2. Zig standard library and compiler runtime
--------------------------------------------

Used for: the plzig-validate tool is compiled from PL/Zig source together
with parts of the Zig standard library (including its tokenizer) and
compiler runtime. The WebAssembly modules that the server compiles from
users' functions likewise contain code from the Zig standard library and
compiler runtime; this matters only if such modules are redistributed.

